WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.850
Have you ever wondered about the deepest desire
of SCP-5094, or Miss J?

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:10.690
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-5094 while

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:15.880
she was instructing a lesson to D-54031 on
the history of Māori culture.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.260
This was the result:

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.960
"D-54031 has a star-shaped sticker reading
"Super Duper!"

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.439
affixed to his chest.

00:00:23.439 --> 00:00:28.920
There is a package of peanut butter crackers
next to the terminal hosting SCP-5094, opened

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.179
and half-eaten."

00:00:30.179 --> 00:00:34.410
It seems that Miss J just wants to keep doing
what she does best: teaching.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.380
Also, she might want some peanut butter crackers.

